message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Live Translation & Subtitles"
abstract: >-
  A Tauri desktop application for Windows and macOS (Apple silicon) that
  produces real-time captions for hybrid and in-person conferences. It captures
  a presenter's microphone, system audio from any application, or both, and
  renders captions in a transparent, always-on-top overlay. Two modes are kept
  deliberately separate: live translation into provider-supported target
  languages via Google Gemini, OpenAI or DeepL, or into English locally via
  Whisper, and same-language subtitles locally via Whisper or through Mistral
  Voxtral or Google Gemini. Built
  for the workshop "Digital Humanities and Artificial Intelligence in African
  Studies" / "Humanités numériques et intelligence artificielle en études
  africaines" (STIAS, Stellenbosch, 21-24 September 2026).
type: software
